{"id":"n72392-2-9","stage":1,"title":"풍경 · 情景","scene":"孩子弄乱的房间","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72392-2-9-1","ko":"방 안 풍경이 왜 이래?","zh":"房间里的样子怎么变成这样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"풍경이","meaning":"情景，景象","explanation":"풍경：情景，景象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"2","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풍경이","audio":"/audio/7a3e157e06d413ac5869.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이래?","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이래","audio":"/audio/3a39ae7086b354ae31c7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"