":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"呗、嘛","explanation":"句末 뭐 表示事情就是这样、无须再多说，语气随意。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"4e685d1e935cf690","term":"어지르다","zh":"弄乱","audio":"/audio/4e685d1e935cf690d3d5.mp3","entryId":"67097","definition":"将整理好的事情或东西弄混杂。","pronunciation":["어지르다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"做完后保持结果（-아/어 놓다）","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"辅助动词；表示前一动作完成后其结果仍持续，这里指弄乱后一直保持乱的状态。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"呗、嘛","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"用于句末，表示事情就是这样、无须多说。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/63e41e28a9710a3411c2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72392","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.6844,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["还不是孩子们弄乱了呗。","你问过我们要找的地方在哪儿了吗？","房间里的样子怎么变成这样了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还不是孩子们弄乱了呗。","房间里的样子怎么变成这样了？","你问过我们要找的地方在哪儿了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
